// Purpose: key rack with five glued-in hooks (assembly) – board with corners rounded via
// zones and a chamfered front edge, keyhole hanger at the back, letter groove on top;
// hooks as a sweep along a spline path with a ball knob and a peg, as parts h[0] …
// h[4] in a loop (export per hook). Dimensions via include, parts via use. Fit peg ↔
// bore: `mcad measure key_rack.mcad --interference --clearance board h[0]`. Dimensions in mm.
include <dimensions.mcad>
use <parts.mcad>

board: board();
for (i = [0 : count - 1])
    translate([hook_x(i), 0, hook_z]) h[i]: hook();
